WEBVTT

01:59.920 --> 02:01.720
- Good morning, Mr. Tang.
- Good morning.

02:07.160 --> 02:08.840
Why did you come up
from the underground garage?

02:09.360 --> 02:10.639
Did you buy a car?

02:12.040 --> 02:13.080
No.

02:13.160 --> 02:14.280
I got it.

02:15.000 --> 02:16.160
Someone gave you a ride.

02:21.880 --> 02:24.120
- I gave--
- It must be your sister, right?

02:25.120 --> 02:26.360
Your sister is so kind.

02:26.880 --> 02:28.160
You're so smart.

02:28.240 --> 02:29.640
Thank you.

02:37.080 --> 02:38.520
In my heart,

02:38.600 --> 02:41.720
Dr. Tang is the smartest person
in our company.

02:55.360 --> 02:56.200
Mr. Tang.

02:57.960 --> 03:01.280
Don't be so polite. If I make a mistake,
you can just scold me.

03:04.920 --> 03:05.760
Su Chengcheng, right?

03:07.440 --> 03:08.480
Yes.

03:20.600 --> 03:23.000
The extrovert person was freaked out
by the introverted person.

03:34.680 --> 03:35.520
Su Chengcheng!

03:36.680 --> 03:38.480
I think something big is happening.

03:39.680 --> 03:41.200
Mr. Tang is so strange.

03:41.280 --> 03:43.120
Young man, don't overthink it.

03:59.600 --> 04:00.440
Mr. Zhou, Mr. Gu.

04:08.200 --> 04:09.400
As you know,

04:09.480 --> 04:12.280
Mr. Zhou and I
just visited Bai Mingzhu's team.

04:14.000 --> 04:16.680
There's good news and bad news.

04:16.760 --> 04:18.120
Which one do you want to know first?

04:24.640 --> 04:27.360
The bad news is, starting today,

04:27.880 --> 04:29.280
you have to work overtime.

04:33.600 --> 04:35.360
I knew it.

04:38.840 --> 04:41.120
Mr. Zhou, what's the good news?

04:42.880 --> 04:44.360
The good news is,

04:45.560 --> 04:47.160
Ms. Bai Mingzhu…

04:49.800 --> 04:51.280
agreed to be our brand ambassador!

04:52.520 --> 04:53.360
Really?

04:57.960 --> 04:59.280
That's the art of speaking.

04:59.360 --> 05:01.640
See? They're happy to work overtime.

05:03.800 --> 05:05.240
Ms. Bai is picky about products.

05:05.320 --> 05:07.000
It's really rare for her
to accept our invitation.

05:07.080 --> 05:11.160
So, I hope you try your best
and don't let Ms. Bai down.

05:11.240 --> 05:12.880
- No problem!
- Absolutely!

05:12.960 --> 05:13.880
Try your best!

05:13.960 --> 05:15.680
- Try our best!
- Try our best!

05:19.720 --> 05:23.840
TBC

05:43.080 --> 05:46.240
We're planning to use technology
to go back in time.

05:46.320 --> 05:49.200
We'll use the phantom imaging technology
in holographic projection

05:49.280 --> 05:51.520
to present middle-aged
and younger versions of Ms. Bai.

05:52.200 --> 05:53.360
The VR technology

05:53.440 --> 05:56.800
will let the audience see Ms. Bai
perform on the stage

05:56.880 --> 05:59.160
with different versions of her
at the ages of 22 and 42.

06:00.000 --> 06:00.840
Younger version.

06:01.680 --> 06:02.960
- Middle-aged version.
- Yes.

06:03.040 --> 06:06.720
If we make it happen,
not only Ms. Bai will like it,

06:06.800 --> 06:10.000
but Ms. Bai's fans will be so excited.

06:12.520 --> 06:14.880
I want to talk
to the technical director alone.

06:14.960 --> 06:15.800
Okay.

06:17.360 --> 06:19.040
- Hello.
- Hello.

07:17.040 --> 07:18.000
Why are you here?

07:18.080 --> 07:19.560
To check on you.

07:21.600 --> 07:22.920
You've been standing all day.

07:23.000 --> 07:23.920
You must be tired.

07:25.520 --> 07:26.560
I brought you shoes.

07:28.480 --> 07:30.160
I can do it myself.

07:38.200 --> 07:39.200
Thanks.

07:39.920 --> 07:41.800
You should wear comfortable shoes

07:41.880 --> 07:44.040
when participating in activities.

07:44.120 --> 07:45.360
It's tiring to wear high heels.

07:51.640 --> 07:54.360
But we sell beauty.

07:55.240 --> 07:58.200
Will Wang Yi and Zhao Yunjie
think you're not serious about work

07:58.280 --> 07:59.880
just because you wear flat shoes?

08:00.400 --> 08:01.760
Of course not.

08:06.600 --> 08:07.600
I understand.

08:08.120 --> 08:09.240
When you first came,

08:09.320 --> 08:12.480
you were worried they'd judge
your capability by your appearance.

08:13.320 --> 08:15.480
But you should be confident
in yourself now.

08:16.520 --> 08:18.920
You've proved yourself
with your hard work.

08:23.800 --> 08:25.640
That's such a cliche.

08:28.080 --> 08:28.920
I…

08:29.480 --> 08:30.920
I'm not good at this.

08:33.000 --> 08:36.640
I feel much better now.
It's comfortable. Thanks.

08:38.600 --> 08:39.760
How will you thank me?

08:59.320 --> 09:00.360
Tang…

09:00.960 --> 09:02.120
Mr. Tang.

09:05.760 --> 09:06.840
Well…

09:10.640 --> 09:13.800
You're so neat.

09:14.440 --> 09:15.800
The mop…

09:17.240 --> 09:18.720
You need to use the mop…

09:19.760 --> 09:21.520
Yes, to clean up.

09:26.720 --> 09:27.800
If you say so.

09:28.840 --> 09:31.920
Well, I'll… leave you alone.

09:32.000 --> 09:34.120
Go ahead.

09:39.040 --> 09:41.080
Is he under a lot of pressure?

09:48.800 --> 09:49.920
Sorry.

09:50.000 --> 09:51.840
I'm not ready.

09:51.920 --> 09:54.160
I don't know how to face my colleagues.

10:00.120 --> 10:01.080
It's okay.

10:02.040 --> 10:03.720
We have plenty of time.

10:04.680 --> 10:05.800
No need to rush.

10:10.080 --> 10:11.720
Su Chengcheng. Su Chengcheng.

10:14.040 --> 10:15.200
Go ahead.

10:15.800 --> 10:17.040
Then, I'm leaving.

11:02.520 --> 11:05.720
Astragalus and Siberian ginseng
can help you relax.

11:06.480 --> 11:09.240
Drink it in the morning
instead of at night.

11:10.640 --> 11:11.480
Thanks.

11:14.640 --> 11:15.600
Go back to rest.

11:19.120 --> 11:20.920
They're hugging!

11:21.000 --> 11:22.800
Is it a little bit fast?

11:22.880 --> 11:23.880
Not at all.

11:23.960 --> 11:26.440
It's normal for young couples
to hug each other.

11:26.520 --> 11:28.240
Otherwise, something must be wrong.

11:29.600 --> 11:30.720
Then, I'm leaving.

11:57.240 --> 11:58.840
This is too much.

11:58.920 --> 12:00.720
Not at all.

12:06.560 --> 12:08.440
I don't want to leave.

12:12.200 --> 12:13.240
Well…

12:14.840 --> 12:15.680
I'll walk you upstairs.

12:27.320 --> 12:29.000
Chengcheng's boyfriend
is going to visit us.

12:29.080 --> 12:30.440
This is too fast!

12:30.520 --> 12:33.320
But he brought a gift.
We can't embarrass Chengcheng.

12:33.400 --> 12:34.760
- Oh no!
- Let's get prepared!

12:34.840 --> 12:35.880
Get prepared!

12:35.960 --> 12:37.080
Let's get changed.

12:55.880 --> 12:58.200
Are you going out?

13:00.520 --> 13:01.440
No.

13:02.960 --> 13:04.960
Are you alone?

13:07.360 --> 13:09.840
Didn't anyone come back with you?

13:12.840 --> 13:15.760
Who's supposed to come back with me?

13:19.080 --> 13:21.400
We're talking about Yuan.

13:22.080 --> 13:23.320
Didn't Yuan come with you?

13:25.040 --> 13:26.120
No.

13:28.280 --> 13:32.160
Are these for us?

13:33.680 --> 13:34.520
No.

13:35.360 --> 13:37.440
This is my shoes.

13:39.120 --> 13:40.840
And this is

13:41.440 --> 13:43.080
the herb tea from my colleague.

13:54.720 --> 13:57.320
Do you know something?

13:58.160 --> 14:00.640
Oh no. We don't know anything.

14:01.360 --> 14:03.000
Su, do you know something?

14:03.080 --> 14:03.920
I don't know.

14:05.320 --> 14:09.480
Chengcheng, should we know something?

14:11.640 --> 14:12.480
No.

14:16.040 --> 14:17.320
Let's get changed.

14:17.840 --> 14:19.520
It's so tight.

14:19.600 --> 14:20.440
Rest early.

14:26.800 --> 14:28.920
Lin Yuan, you traitor!

14:48.440 --> 14:49.280
Hello.

14:49.800 --> 14:50.840
My parents…

14:53.120 --> 14:55.720
Do they know
I'm in a relationship with Tang Qi?

14:57.080 --> 15:00.440
They were beside me when I received
your WeChat message.

15:00.520 --> 15:02.400
I didn't mean to.

15:04.080 --> 15:07.240
Don't tell them
I know they already know it.

15:07.320 --> 15:09.440
Otherwise, I'll tell them
Gu Yu and you are in a relationship.

15:12.000 --> 15:14.080
Do you think they don't know?

15:14.160 --> 15:15.560
We're both doom--

15:22.200 --> 15:25.920
It's just a matter of time.

15:26.000 --> 15:27.160
None of us can get away.

15:28.240 --> 15:31.120
I want to stall for time as long as I can.

15:31.200 --> 15:35.200
Anyway, don't let them find out
I know they already know it, okay?

15:36.280 --> 15:37.640
Okay.

15:43.000 --> 15:45.080
Tang Qi and I kissed.

15:45.680 --> 15:46.960
What about you?

15:58.280 --> 15:59.160
Not yet.

15:59.240 --> 16:00.280
Not yet?

16:00.880 --> 16:03.080
Gu Yu looks so skilled at this.

16:03.160 --> 16:04.640
Why is he acting innocent?

16:06.080 --> 16:07.400
I have something important to do.

16:07.480 --> 16:08.800
Where are you?

16:11.400 --> 16:12.560
At home.

16:13.840 --> 16:14.840
Is Gu Yu with you?

16:17.560 --> 16:19.240
What a mesmerizing night!

16:21.280 --> 16:24.360
Do you know how to spell that word?

16:27.360 --> 16:28.480
I don't know.

16:28.560 --> 16:30.680
But I know how to spell "bed".

16:33.240 --> 16:34.840
I don't want to talk to you. Bye.

16:43.040 --> 16:45.200
Shall we go on with the movie?

17:41.600 --> 17:42.680
What are you doing?

18:56.800 --> 18:58.720
WHITE PONY, TIME TRAVEL SERIES
NEW PRODUCT LAUNCH CONFERENCE

19:00.880 --> 19:02.800
TIME FLIES BY, BUT THE FRAGRANCE REMAINS

19:02.880 --> 19:03.800
MAIN VENUE

19:03.880 --> 19:05.840
TIME FLIES BY, BUT THE FRAGRANCE REMAINS

19:05.920 --> 19:09.040
BAI MINGZHU

19:20.880 --> 19:22.080
It has begun.

20:17.720 --> 20:18.800
This…

20:18.880 --> 20:20.440
The left part is missing.

20:24.680 --> 20:26.000
And the right part too.

20:28.320 --> 20:29.560
Sorry, I was so clumsy.

20:29.640 --> 20:32.800
I was curious about the device.
I didn't know this could happen.

20:32.880 --> 20:35.520
It has happened. We should find a way.

20:36.520 --> 20:37.680
Please try again.

20:37.760 --> 20:39.360
We've tried our best.

20:40.480 --> 20:42.160
The introduction of the flowers
is about to end.

20:56.960 --> 20:59.360
Everyone is looking forward to this.

20:59.880 --> 21:02.600
I'm also looking forward
to seeing myself at the age of 22.

21:07.920 --> 21:08.800
Ms. Bai,

21:09.320 --> 21:11.200
something's wrong
with the holographic projection.

21:11.280 --> 21:12.520
We're trying to fix it.

21:13.040 --> 21:15.280
But we need to adjust
the performance order.

21:15.800 --> 21:18.720
Can you get on the stage first
to stall for time?

21:21.320 --> 21:22.160
What?

21:22.880 --> 21:24.360
How could this happen?

21:29.680 --> 21:31.640
Okay, no problem.

21:33.320 --> 21:35.720
- Thanks, Ms. Bai.
- Thanks, Ms. Bai.

22:12.440 --> 22:14.320
What's wrong? Is there a problem?

22:16.800 --> 22:18.680
To draw people's attention,

22:18.760 --> 22:21.200
22-year-old Bai Mingzhu
is supposed to show up first.

22:25.520 --> 22:30.080
Play cool in front of the mirror

22:32.240 --> 22:36.840
Tired of waiting for my destiny

22:38.120 --> 22:41.120
Why am I so helpless?

22:41.200 --> 22:42.560
BAI MINGZHU

22:42.640 --> 22:43.680
Where are you going?

22:44.200 --> 22:49.600
Who's surrounded by loneliness

22:51.120 --> 22:52.240
SYSTEM MALFUNCTION

22:52.320 --> 22:54.520
Hello. Something's wrong with our devices.

22:54.600 --> 22:56.040
When can you get here?

22:56.720 --> 22:58.640
Well… Are you the only one?

22:59.160 --> 23:00.120
- How's it going?
- Got it.

23:00.640 --> 23:01.480
Bye.

23:02.240 --> 23:04.160
Ms. Bai is about to finish this song.

23:04.840 --> 23:05.960
Sorry.

23:06.040 --> 23:07.400
We have to wait
for the expert to fix this.

23:07.480 --> 23:09.520
He'll come here in about 30 minutes.

23:09.600 --> 23:10.760
It's too late.

23:10.840 --> 23:13.400
The conference will end in half an hour.

23:17.160 --> 23:19.000
Don't panic. There must be a way.

23:26.160 --> 23:27.640
I do have an idea.

23:33.200 --> 23:35.400
Sorry, please leave this room immediately.

23:35.480 --> 23:36.320
Right now.

23:36.400 --> 23:37.440
This…

23:38.120 --> 23:39.080
Everyone, please leave.

23:39.760 --> 23:40.600
Let's go.

23:44.120 --> 23:46.320
- Su Chengcheng…
- It's okay. Just go.

23:57.640 --> 23:59.200
What's your solution?

23:59.280 --> 24:06.280
Let's become the dust of love

24:07.880 --> 24:11.960
Floating in the air of happiness

24:12.040 --> 24:13.040
BAI MINGZHU

24:13.120 --> 24:19.880
Gently swaying

24:26.000 --> 24:27.000
Great!

24:46.800 --> 24:48.200
Is something wrong?

25:05.560 --> 25:08.520
I can see many new faces

25:09.400 --> 25:11.120
as well as familiar faces.

25:12.040 --> 25:14.040
I'm looking forward to seeing

25:14.560 --> 25:17.120
myself from 40 years ago.

25:18.600 --> 25:20.680
But that version of me is capricious.

25:21.920 --> 25:22.920
She won't show up.

25:24.800 --> 25:26.440
Isn't this a malfunction?

25:30.840 --> 25:33.880
I know I've let you down.

25:35.160 --> 25:37.040
3D Projection begins.

25:37.120 --> 25:38.840
Three, two, one.

25:39.920 --> 25:43.240
I'm capricious and won't show up?

25:45.120 --> 25:46.960
Who's saying bad things about me?

25:50.360 --> 25:52.480
BAI MINGZHU

25:58.560 --> 26:00.400
The younger version of me
is really troublesome.

26:01.440 --> 26:04.000
Please don't blame her.

26:15.560 --> 26:16.960
There's another one!

26:25.520 --> 26:27.480
Sorry for the wait.

26:27.560 --> 26:29.960
The prom is about to start.

26:36.000 --> 26:39.160
BAI MINGZHU

26:45.360 --> 26:48.080
Spend every day with you

26:49.040 --> 26:50.800
The stage effect is impressive.

26:50.880 --> 26:51.720
It is.

26:51.800 --> 26:55.880
Watching the clouds generating rain
And the leaves falling down

26:55.960 --> 26:59.000
Staring at you affectionately

26:59.600 --> 27:02.800
Saying I love you in every way

27:02.880 --> 27:05.960
All hidden in the details

27:06.480 --> 27:10.320
Looking back and longing for eternity

27:10.400 --> 27:13.120
Can't wait to tell you I do

27:14.440 --> 27:17.800
You're my one and only

27:17.880 --> 27:19.720
BAI MINGZHU

27:21.720 --> 27:25.480
I'm greedy and petty because of you

27:25.560 --> 27:28.640
I'm naughty and capricious because of you

27:28.720 --> 27:30.680
All because of you

27:36.720 --> 27:38.920
BAI MINGZHU

28:04.520 --> 28:06.160
Time passes

28:06.760 --> 28:08.400
in the blink of an eye.

28:09.760 --> 28:12.520
Time will never stop.

28:13.440 --> 28:15.680
In our lives,

28:15.760 --> 28:18.160
memory is like a boat,

28:19.120 --> 28:21.880
carrying all our past,

28:22.760 --> 28:25.880
taking us to where they are.

28:26.960 --> 28:28.600
Memory is a fragrance

28:28.680 --> 28:30.040
that will never cease.

28:30.560 --> 28:33.880
I hope you can dance with beauty

28:33.960 --> 28:36.440
on the boat of memory.

28:43.520 --> 28:47.480
TBC

28:58.680 --> 29:04.160
- Great!
- Great!

29:16.600 --> 29:17.480
Thanks!

29:18.000 --> 29:19.000
Congratulations.

29:19.080 --> 29:20.240
Thank you for your support.

29:20.840 --> 29:21.880
Great!

29:33.480 --> 29:34.320
Great!

29:49.880 --> 29:55.200
CENTRAL CONTROL ROOM

29:55.280 --> 29:57.040
Mr. Gu, can I come in?

29:58.760 --> 29:59.760
Come in.

30:05.560 --> 30:06.920
Mr. Gu, this…

30:09.520 --> 30:10.720
It went back to normal,

30:11.360 --> 30:12.560
but now it's broken again.

30:15.520 --> 30:16.520
Thank God.

30:17.120 --> 30:18.640
The launch conference was a success.

30:29.080 --> 30:30.120
Thanks.

30:32.280 --> 30:33.880
Did you see them
transform into someone else?

30:35.960 --> 30:37.600
They had explained it to me,

30:37.680 --> 30:40.440
but I was really shocked when I saw Tang

30:40.520 --> 30:43.640
turn into a woman.

30:45.760 --> 30:47.160
Mr. Gu, thank you for covering for us.

30:47.760 --> 30:49.240
Just call me Gu Yu in private.

30:49.320 --> 30:51.160
I did it for the company and for myself.

30:51.240 --> 30:52.320
Okay.

30:55.880 --> 30:58.960
I should thank you
for saving our launch conference.

31:00.200 --> 31:02.160
- It's my duty.
- Come on.

31:06.120 --> 31:07.960
Let's have a drink.

31:08.800 --> 31:10.480
Join us.

31:10.560 --> 31:13.320
Congratulations, Yuan, Gu Yu.

31:13.400 --> 31:16.240
You two are like a dramatic couple
in a TV series.

31:16.320 --> 31:17.280
From enemies to lovers.

31:17.360 --> 31:18.840
Congratulations to you.

31:18.920 --> 31:20.640
You two are also like
a couple in a TV series.

31:20.720 --> 31:21.880
Though there's no reincarnation,

31:21.960 --> 31:23.600
you became so many different people.

31:23.680 --> 31:25.640
You went through the hardest times
and finally got together.

31:25.720 --> 31:26.560
Cheers.

31:32.440 --> 31:35.000
In this round, you two are equally good.

31:35.080 --> 31:36.080
Chengcheng won.

31:36.600 --> 31:37.440
Give me a reason.

31:37.520 --> 31:39.160
He's biased toward her.

31:40.320 --> 31:41.720
Because you got it wrong.

31:41.800 --> 31:44.480
I was the one who went
through hardships, not Chengcheng.

31:47.520 --> 31:48.600
You have no idea.

31:49.120 --> 31:51.600
When Tang fell in love with Fang Jin,

31:51.680 --> 31:52.920
he drank a lot in pain

31:53.000 --> 31:54.720
and called himself a scum.

32:03.200 --> 32:05.320
Mr. Tang, I'm sorry.

32:05.400 --> 32:07.080
It's all my fault.

32:10.040 --> 32:12.000
I'm willing to be fooled

32:12.080 --> 32:12.920
by you.

32:16.720 --> 32:19.960
Tang Qi, I didn't know you were so sweet.

32:21.080 --> 32:23.040
I need to add this conversation
to my comics.

32:26.560 --> 32:27.400
Am I not sweet?

32:31.160 --> 32:32.440
What did he say?

32:32.520 --> 32:33.720
He said he was also sweet.

32:34.760 --> 32:36.360
Lin Yuan, Lin Yuan!

32:36.440 --> 32:38.720
Tell us more, please! Come on!

32:38.800 --> 32:40.680
- It's too wild to talk about in public.
- Yogurt.

32:40.760 --> 32:43.320
- Let's drink.
- Tell us.

32:43.920 --> 32:44.760
Don't drink too much.

32:45.280 --> 32:47.320
I'm happy.

32:49.800 --> 32:51.240
Well, that night, we…

32:58.440 --> 32:59.880
It's coming. Come on.

33:02.080 --> 33:03.320
There's more.

33:04.920 --> 33:07.600
Su Chengcheng, our perfume has gone viral!

33:07.680 --> 33:08.720
Come on!

33:09.240 --> 33:10.080
Since last night,

33:10.160 --> 33:11.600
- it got five hot topics.
- Let me see.

33:11.680 --> 33:13.120
Now, it's still in the top 3!

33:13.200 --> 33:14.040
Look at this.

33:14.120 --> 33:15.400
In Perfume Rankings,

33:15.480 --> 33:16.920
White Pony is the winner.

33:17.000 --> 33:20.360
The sales volume of our flagship store
is now the third place in all kinds.

33:20.880 --> 33:23.120
The credit goes to everyone.

33:23.200 --> 33:25.680
Thanks. Thanks. Thanks!

33:25.760 --> 33:27.320
It's like an imitation show.

33:27.400 --> 33:28.440
She's not sincere.

33:28.520 --> 33:33.000
What? Thanks. Thank you so much!

33:41.400 --> 33:42.600
You look happy.

33:46.160 --> 33:47.160
There's something better.

33:50.280 --> 33:52.640
Here's the extra reward for you.

33:52.720 --> 33:54.000
It's real money.

33:54.080 --> 33:55.280
A 3000-yuan voucher for everyone.

33:55.360 --> 33:56.880
You can use it or give it to your family.

33:58.600 --> 34:00.320
- Thank you.
- Thanks, Mr. Gu!

34:00.400 --> 34:01.600
Hand them out.

34:10.199 --> 34:11.280
What a coincidence.

34:12.080 --> 34:14.080
Indeed. Allow me.

34:20.480 --> 34:21.320
Thanks.

34:31.960 --> 34:33.320
Mr. Tang.

34:34.159 --> 34:35.719
I also want to drink your handmade coffee.

34:39.560 --> 34:40.400
Help yourself.

34:46.960 --> 34:48.400
Mr. Tang doesn't like me.

34:48.480 --> 34:50.960
It'd be strange if he liked you.

34:51.600 --> 34:53.600
Su Chengcheng,
I need to tell you something.

34:55.880 --> 34:57.280
What?

34:57.360 --> 34:58.960
I…

35:00.480 --> 35:01.400
I…

35:04.880 --> 35:08.120
I was clumsy and broke the controller.
I almost ruined everything.

35:08.720 --> 35:11.080
Thank you for not telling Mr. Gu
about my mistake.

35:11.160 --> 35:13.320
I'll be very careful next time.
It won't happen again.

35:13.400 --> 35:16.080
It's okay.
It's hard to avoid making mistakes.

35:16.160 --> 35:18.560
As colleagues, we should help each other.

35:18.640 --> 35:20.240
- Bye.
- Wait a minute.

35:20.320 --> 35:22.640
I want to find you a boyfriend.

35:23.160 --> 35:25.800
My friends are all single.
They like sports.

35:25.880 --> 35:27.400
Choose someone you like.

35:27.480 --> 35:30.040
I'll set up a date for you this weekend.

35:33.960 --> 35:35.720
You're so kind.

35:35.800 --> 35:36.840
But

35:36.920 --> 35:38.320
I already have a boyfriend.

35:39.560 --> 35:40.640
You have a boyfriend?

35:40.720 --> 35:42.000
When?

35:43.240 --> 35:44.440
Not long ago.

35:45.560 --> 35:46.760
What's he like?

35:58.320 --> 36:01.720
He's always in the lab,

36:01.800 --> 36:03.440
doesn't like socializing,

36:03.520 --> 36:06.560
and is very serious about work.

36:08.560 --> 36:11.360
Mr. Tang. Did you forget something?

36:13.840 --> 36:15.400
I left my girlfriend here.

36:18.400 --> 36:19.440
Let me introduce you.

36:19.520 --> 36:21.440
This is my boyfriend.

36:31.680 --> 36:34.920
I've noticed Mr. Tang
has been acting strange.

36:35.440 --> 36:36.280
Well…

36:36.360 --> 36:38.280
The other day, in the elevator,

36:38.360 --> 36:40.720
you… I…

36:41.800 --> 36:43.440
I… You…

36:43.520 --> 36:44.440
I'll leave you alone.

36:53.040 --> 36:54.480
He forgot to make coffee.

37:14.600 --> 37:15.760
No rush.

37:16.280 --> 37:17.400
We have plenty of time.

37:18.480 --> 37:19.920
We chose the wrong restaurant.

37:20.000 --> 37:22.080
Everyone is here. Hurry up and leave.

37:25.640 --> 37:26.600
Look at the camera.

37:35.200 --> 37:37.440
Let's focus on the meal.

37:37.520 --> 37:38.480
Just ignore them.

37:39.680 --> 37:42.360
When I was little, I went out
with my sister, and people would judge me.

37:42.440 --> 37:45.480
We were clearly wearing the same clothes.

37:45.560 --> 37:48.200
But she was tall and slim,

37:48.280 --> 37:49.240
while I was

37:50.920 --> 37:51.760
short and dirty.

37:53.200 --> 37:54.840
They even asked me

37:55.840 --> 37:57.600
if we were real sisters.

37:57.680 --> 37:59.680
My mom was so pissed off.

38:03.800 --> 38:06.160
Are you worried
that they're talking about us?

38:08.240 --> 38:10.160
You're such a good guy.

38:10.240 --> 38:11.800
Now that we're together,

38:11.880 --> 38:15.120
maybe people are also wondering
if we're really in a relationship.

38:20.240 --> 38:22.160
In this world,

38:22.240 --> 38:23.720
there are all kinds of people

38:23.800 --> 38:25.560
and all kinds of opinions.

38:26.200 --> 38:29.080
There are bad ones as well as good ones.

38:29.160 --> 38:32.040
I believe there are more good people.

38:32.560 --> 38:34.880
I think more people would think

38:34.960 --> 38:36.520
that this good guy

38:37.600 --> 38:39.320
loves this girl so much

38:39.840 --> 38:42.120
because she's also a great person.

38:59.520 --> 39:02.080
This world can be changed.

39:02.600 --> 39:04.520
No matter what they used to think,

39:04.600 --> 39:06.440
we can change their opinions.

39:09.840 --> 39:11.800
Aren't you ashamed of flattering yourself?

39:12.720 --> 39:14.080
Am I not great?

39:14.720 --> 39:17.080
You're great. But I'm also great.

39:17.160 --> 39:19.480
I'm great, and so are you.

39:19.560 --> 39:21.240
It's a fact

39:21.320 --> 39:22.520
that cannot be denied.

39:46.120 --> 39:47.520
Shall we share a table with them?

39:57.120 --> 39:59.080
You must've known this.

39:59.720 --> 40:00.680
However,

40:00.760 --> 40:02.320
I still need to say this formally.

40:07.840 --> 40:09.320
We are in a relationship.

40:14.080 --> 40:16.840
Then, I'll also introduce him.

40:16.920 --> 40:19.320
This is Tang Qi, my boyfriend.

40:19.400 --> 40:22.280
Hope you like him as much as you like me.

40:22.360 --> 40:23.880
If you don't like him, it's okay.

40:23.960 --> 40:26.400
After all, he's got my love.

40:30.000 --> 40:31.080
Mr. Tang.

40:31.160 --> 40:32.520
Here's to you and Chengcheng.

40:32.600 --> 40:35.360
Hope you can always be happy
and sweet like today.

40:35.440 --> 40:36.280
- That's right.
- Thanks.

40:36.360 --> 40:38.240
Wish you happiness.

40:38.320 --> 40:39.360
Thank you.

40:39.440 --> 40:41.920
- Thank you so much.
- Thanks.

40:42.000 --> 40:43.360
You can't drink. Give it to me.

40:43.440 --> 40:45.800
They're very kind to me. I want to drink.

40:46.560 --> 40:47.440
Okay.

40:50.960 --> 40:51.920
Sit down.

40:52.600 --> 40:53.440
Come on.

40:57.440 --> 40:59.320
It hasn't been easy for him to get you.

40:59.920 --> 41:02.480
- Mr. Tang, we want to drink with you.
- Yes. Congratulations, Mr. Tang.

41:05.200 --> 41:07.400
I've never seen him so happy like this.

41:08.320 --> 41:11.840
Mr. Tang, when did it happen?
Why didn't we know anything?

41:11.920 --> 41:14.760
The first time I met you and Chengcheng,
I knew you'd be a great couple.

41:14.840 --> 41:15.840
- Absolutely!
- Right?

41:15.920 --> 41:17.240
Tell us.

41:17.320 --> 41:21.280
- It turns out we can really change
- If I had known

41:21.360 --> 41:23.400
- what others think of us.
- Let's eat first.

41:23.480 --> 41:24.600
It's getting cold.

41:24.680 --> 41:26.040
Let's eat.

41:29.400 --> 41:31.240
We're home.

41:34.600 --> 41:37.320
Don't throw me down.

41:38.120 --> 41:40.120
Don't throw me down.

41:42.120 --> 41:43.560
Throw you down?

41:53.560 --> 41:54.960
You still remember that?

42:22.000 --> 42:23.080
Su Chengcheng!

42:23.160 --> 42:24.680
What's wrong?

42:24.760 --> 42:25.920
Are you not feeling well?

42:28.600 --> 42:30.160
I like you.

42:32.280 --> 42:33.960
I like you, too.

42:35.200 --> 42:36.720
Go to sleep.

42:48.600 --> 42:49.640
Su Chengcheng!

42:49.720 --> 42:51.040
I'm here.

42:54.360 --> 42:55.840
I like you.

42:57.640 --> 42:59.640
I like you, too.

43:01.920 --> 43:03.600
Go to sleep.

43:21.080 --> 43:22.320
Su Chengcheng!

43:30.840 --> 43:31.960
I…

43:36.320 --> 43:37.760
Su Chengcheng.

43:37.840 --> 43:40.600
I… I like you.

43:43.600 --> 43:45.080
I want a hug.

43:45.160 --> 43:46.600
Okay, hug.

43:49.040 --> 43:51.760
Should I let you drink or not?

43:53.200 --> 43:55.000
I love you.

43:57.400 --> 43:59.240
I love you, too.

44:01.440 --> 44:03.160
Not on weekdays.

44:03.680 --> 44:06.120
We can drink on weekends.

44:16.520 --> 44:17.760
Let me go.

44:17.840 --> 44:19.040
No.

44:20.080 --> 44:22.240
Sleep together.

44:25.080 --> 44:28.040
Forget it. Not on weekends either.

44:29.800 --> 44:33.680
I want to go to the bathroom.

44:35.640 --> 44:36.960
Then go.

44:38.000 --> 44:41.160
I'm too weak to get up.

44:44.640 --> 44:47.200
You should definitely quit drinking.
